{{also|Drucken|drücken|Drücken}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|drucken}}, from {{inh|de|goh|drucchen}}. From {{der|de|gem-pro|*þrukkijaną||to press}}. Closely cognate with {{cog|de|drücken||to press, push}}: {{m|de||drucken}} is originally the southern form; the first German printers were in the south.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈdʁʊkŋ̩]|[ˈdʁʊkən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-drucken.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-drucken.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}

